# sequin's pages for the contact sheet (tools/contact_sheet.py): the engine picked from SEL's list, its first preset,
# a note playing, the knobs at their ends, the table and the noise, the Sub page at its ends, a drum preset
#   app/build/host/loom_host tools/p2/sequin.xy OUT
wait 300
spin ALGO 1
tap EDIT
tap SEL
row ENGINE
turn ALGO 9 30
wait 300
shot 01_List-engine-acid.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
shot 02_List-engine-sequin.png
tap SEL
wait 2500
shot 03_Engine-sequin.png
play 2 60 on 110
wait 300
shot 04_Engine-playing.png
play 2 60 off
wait 300
knob 2 e1 0
knob 2 e2 0
knob 2 e3 0
knob 2 e4 0
wait 2500
shot 05_Engine-knobs-min.png
knob 2 e1 127
knob 2 e2 127
knob 2 e3 127
knob 2 e4 127
wait 2500
shot 06_Engine-knobs-max.png
knob 2 e2 92
knob 2 e3 20
knob 2 e4 30
wait 2500
shot 07_Engine-table-vox.png
knob 2 e1 noise
knob 2 e3 0
wait 2500
shot 08_Engine-noise.png
turn SELECT 3
wait 2500
shot 09_Sub.png
knob 2 x1 0
knob 2 x2 0
knob 2 x3 0
knob 2 x4 0
wait 2500
shot 10_Sub-knobs-min.png
knob 2 x1 127
knob 2 x2 127
knob 2 x3 127
knob 2 x4 127
wait 2500
shot 11_Sub-knobs-max.png
turn SELECT 1
preset 2 chip_kick sequin
wait 2500
shot 12_Engine-chip-kick.png
step 2 1 1 60 110
step 2 1 5 60 110
step 2 1 9 60 110
step 2 1 13 60 110
tap PLAY
bars 0.05
shot 13_Engine-kick-playing.png
bars 1
tap PLAY
